  {
   "rule": "For people in the plural, “these” is <span class='ar'>هَؤُلَاءِ</span> and “those” is <span class='ar'>أُولَئِكَ</span>, for men and women alike. “They” is <span class='ar'>هُمْ</span> for men or a mixed group, and <span class='ar'>هُنَّ</span> for women only."
